{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/962315-oldschool-dungeon-for-mages-don-t-read-if-you-are-playing-with-me","id":962315,"title":"Oldschool dungeon for mages (Don't read if you are playing with me)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-02T08:54:58-07:00","id":962315,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon3.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Oldschool dungeon for mages (Don't read if you are playing with me)","content":"So I'm preparing this dungeon for my players to explore and I want it to have some magical riddles. Kind of optional location that is difficult to progress but rewarding.<br /> It's a long lost magical prison for mages. There's been a mutiny and a fight between sentinels and prisoners who possibly had some help from outside.<br /> Here's the quick layout:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/wibh7dC.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> 1-7 The lower (on the map) part is the entrance, sentinels and chief warden chambers, shrine of The Goddes, kitchen and cantine.<br /> 9-14 Those are actual cells and maybe some sentry post<br /> <br /> Im looking for an inspiration for a 8a-8i corridor which leads to the cells. It suppose to include riddles, barriers, and Cube-like(the movie) traps, some of them might be broken, thus useless, or even more dangerous because of that. There was a battle there and all kinds of things could lurk in there (centuries old paradox and mad spells).<br /> <br /> 8a Is an enhanced rock door with engravings in high speech. It explodes throwing rock in all direction then collapses back into its original shape. Its a loop caused by some time paradox, not really dangerous but gives some idea what have happened here.<br /> 8b<br /> 8c<br /> 8d<br /> 8e<br /> 8f<br /> 8g<br /> 8h Abyssal chasm(verge) that you have to swim and witness many mind bending horrors.<br /> <br /> tl;dr<br /> Any cool ideas for a trap or difficult riddle?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1090276-2e-moinen-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">[2E] Moinen's Homebrew Hub</a></b>","edited":{"userid":1747,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1747-moinen","user":"Moinen","date":". 09-02-2016, 04:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1747-moinen","name":"Moinen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1747_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"889"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-02T12:14:19-07:00","id":962433,"title":"","content":"Here is a riddle for you, or at least a riddle idea:<br /> Use the appropriate item to solve this:<br /> Garter rope nr.<br /> You would use the appropriate item to correct mistakes in writing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/19.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12164-zaephyrus","name":"Zaephyrus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-02T13:13:28-07:00","id":962457,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12164-zaephyrus\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12164_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12164\" data-vbnamecard=\"12164\">Zaephyrus</a> Thanks for sarcasm and sorry for mistakes. I got carried away and didn't proofread it - not the best idea since english is not primary language (as you can see). &quot;Dungerous&quot; is pretty nice mistake <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> Now back to topic. If you could look past my spelling and grammar mistakes I would be very glad if you could help me by giving some ideas <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1090276-2e-moinen-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">[2E] Moinen's Homebrew Hub</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1747-moinen","name":"Moinen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1747_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"889"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-02T13:18:55-07:00","id":962461,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Moinen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/962315-oldschool-dungeon-for-mages-don-t-read-if-you-are-playing-with-me?p=962457#post962457\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12164-zaephyrus\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12164_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12164\" data-vbnamecard=\"12164\">Zaephyrus</a> Thanks for sarcasm and sorry for mistakes. I got carried away and didn't proofread it - not the best idea since english is not primary language (as you can see). &quot;Dungerous&quot; is pretty nice mistake <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> Now back to topic. If you could look past my spelling and grammar mistakes I would be very glad if you could help me by giving some ideas <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I believe I have been misunderstood here. this was in no way related to your writing.<br /> Try removing the letter R from garter rope nr.<br /> the sentence &quot;you would use the apropriate item to correct mistakes in writing&quot; is a reference to an eraser, as in Erase R.<br /> <br /> Yes, it spoils the riddle (which I would have answered within 24 hours) but I feel the need to resolve this misunderstanding.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/19.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12164-zaephyrus","name":"Zaephyrus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-02T15:14:46-07:00","id":962523,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12164-zaephyrus\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12164_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12164\" data-vbnamecard=\"12164\">Zaephyrus</a> I'm sorry... And I feel bad now. I'm 100% sure that I wouldn't be able to guess that - it's a great riddle. Sadly its imposible to translate. <br /> Another thing is that I need those riddles less verbal and more about detective work.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1090276-2e-moinen-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">[2E] Moinen's Homebrew Hub</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1747-moinen","name":"Moinen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1747_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"889"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-02T15:50:13-07:00","id":962541,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1747-moinen\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1747_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1747\" data-vbnamecard=\"1747\">Moinen</a> Ey, it happens to the best of us.<br /> <br /> As for your puzzle problem: Without knowing what your native language is I cannot help you in the translation part and even then it would be a long shot. Maybe think of something similar, but in your native language? the puzzle is centered around the play on words of erasing the letter R and an item named an eraser.<br /> Verbal puzzles could still very well work. Maybe the jailors kept one or more guardian ghosts/spirits/insert entitity around that needs a question answered before it lets the players pass.<br /> Alternatively you could do something with an inscription that needs to be completed or a trap will activate. then you remove parts of the letters that make up the inscription while hiding hints to what word or phrase or name the complete inscription would read as. I had a lot of fun with that in a Pathfinder campaign. It helps if you make the letters very blocky.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/19.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12164-zaephyrus","name":"Zaephyrus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-03T04:24:27-07:00","id":962761,"title":"","content":"My native language is polish. Hmm. And yes, some kind of entity that demands password is a good idea. Perhaps it has grown bored through those centuries and now offers a riddle. Maybe even some kind of JailOS inteligence like Blaine the Mono from Steven King's Dark Tower. Something that looks at the players doings in the whole prison.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1090276-2e-moinen-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">[2E] Moinen's Homebrew Hub</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1747-moinen","name":"Moinen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1747_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"889"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}